    "abstract": "The research contains two parts. Part 1: To explore whether EEG responses to zolpidem can assess consciousness circuit integrity and predict the evolution of consciousness in patients with prolonged disorders of consciousness; Part 2: To explore if quantitative EEG reactivity might predict the prognosis of disorders of consciousness."
